sequenceDiagram
    participant P as EO product (CEMS / Charter / UNOSAT)
    participant E as ETL and pystac-monty
    participant API as Montandon STAC API
    P->>E: ingest, anchored on source_id
    E->>E: derive corr_id from date, country, hazard
    E->>API: Algorithm 1 - find reference event
    API-->>E: matching Event
    E->>API: attach Response with corr_id and reference-event / source-event links
    Note over API: product now discoverable via corr_id and roles = response
